            <title><![CDATA[Candidates enter final week of campaigning with control of Congress at stake]]></title>
            <link>https://www.pbs.org/newshour/show/candidates-enter-final-week-of-campaigning-with-control-of-congress-at-stake</link>
            <description><![CDATA[It's crunch time for candidates across the country with Election Day just over a week away. On Monday, President Trump campaigned in ruby-red Mississippi, a state he won by almost 23 points two years ago. Over the weekend, the battleground state of Michigan saw a political heavyweight bout between Trump and former President Obama. Liz Landers reports. ]]></description>
